    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'll try to drink some more water. but i did notice my heart felt like it was skipping a beat or racing really fast right before it happened. do you think that's just part of the dehydration or should i be taking something for it? like maybe an electrolyte pill or something to steady my heart?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
